  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Integration Support to Asylum Seekers and Beneficiaries of International Protection in Bulgaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project, IOM will provide administrative, legal, health, psychological and social support to asylum seekers and beneficiaries of international protection in Bulgaria. This support will be provided by an expert team consisting of a psychologist, a social worker, and a legal counselor in State Agency for Refugees reception centers.</narrative>
  </description>
